  evidence:
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: CultureBotHT
    notes: Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 343336-76-5 present, but no CHEBI entry
      exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote
      to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term.
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: anchor_cas_hydrate_records
    notes: palatinose hydrate is a hydrate/salt with its own CAS and no exact ChEBI
      term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:18394 '6-O-alpha-D-glucopyranosyl-D-fructofuranose'
      by narrowMatch per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. hydrate of palatinose
      (isomaltulose)
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: MIM curation (#342)
    notes: 'mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch
      -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning*
      than CHEBI:18394 (''6-O-alpha-D-glucopyranosyl-D-fructofuranose'') — a subsumption
      ChEBI itself denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 ''hydrate'', never
      under the anhydrous compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A
      hydrate is a distinct substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization
      of it. closeMatch claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and
      the record''s own identifier are unchanged.'
  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION
    source: MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)
    notes: 'CAS343336-76-5/sourceP2007 denotes variable-hydration palatinose. Preserve
      its separateCASidentity. Supplier and CHEBI:18394 agree the glucopyranosyl-fructofuranose
      core without forcing the reducing-end anomer. See the complete identity, mapping,
      chemistry and synonym assessment in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-c/assessments-v2.json;
      owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/Palatinose_Hydrate.yaml. Primary source
      references: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/18394/;
      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=palatinose%20hydrate&ontology=chebi,ncit&rows=100;
      https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/343336-76-5/JSON; https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/sigma/p2007;
      https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT. Captures, exact input hashes and
      scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json. This
      curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed owner
      bytes withdraw inherited support.'
